estremo sacrificio umano. Quello che le madri fanno per i loro figli."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"After welcoming her baby, Ruby, home, the tightly scripted world of lifestyle influencer Jo starts to unravel. As increasingly sinister happenings mount, Jo is plunged into a waking fever dream where everyone is a threat and nothing is what it seems.","tagline":"A mother's instincts never lie."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xsQyj1RWeKYafKaDRDfA3x5IVcZ.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c4CMeW8B2l0tA3ar5xtjWhALecS.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1008374,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xsQyj1RWeKYafKaDRDfA3x5IVcZ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xsQyj1RWeKYafKaDRDfA3x5IVcZ.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xsQyj1RWeKYafKaDRDfA3x5IVcZ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xsQyj1RWeKYafKaDRDfA3x5IVcZ.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iKUzUIhtDZlzWMCPyq2xTRwnSGN.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iKUzUIhtDZlzWMCPyq2xTRwnSGN.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qUizkrlKbT4nHXUElvnIrjcPsDd.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qUizkrlKbT4nHXUElvnIrjcPsDd.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lVBKwdioZyUTJulzuZ99g70QQPP.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lVBKwdioZyUTJulzuZ99g70QQPP.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p